{
  "name": "Share new blog articles on social media from RSS with Rizamo",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Share new blog articles from RSS\n\nEvery new article in your feed is added to a Rizamo profile's queue, so it goes out at the next free posting time.\n\n### Setup\n1. In Rizamo, open **Developers** and create an API key.\n2. In n8n, add a **Rizamo API** credential with it.\n3. Install the node first if needed: Settings, Community Nodes, `@rizamohq/n8n-nodes-rizamo`.\n4. Put your feed's address in **New article**.\n5. In **Add to queue**, pick the profile and accounts.\n\nInstagram and TikTok need an image or video: set Media to File URLs and map your feed's image there.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 560
      },
      "id": "21c7f3a0-145d-4e6b-904e-d990639a7782",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "feedUrl": "https://your-blog.com/feed",
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyHour"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "eb94a137-7d82-49c2-ba22-8a97c133421a",
      "name": "New article",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.rssFeedReadTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "post",
        "operation": "create",
        "profileId": "",
        "accountIds": [],
        "text": "={{ $json.title }}\n\n{{ $json.contentSnippet ? $json.contentSnippet.slice(0, 200) + '...\\n\\n' : '' }}{{ $json.link }}",
        "when": "queue",
        "mediaSource": "none",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "6b7af1ba-0f50-40ba-9cda-5dde88170fda",
      "name": "Add to queue",
      "type": "@rizamohq/n8n-nodes-rizamo.rizamo",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "New article": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Add to queue",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
